WEBVTT

01:25.000 --> 01:28.080
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:36.480 --> 01:37.520
Hurry up!

01:44.720 --> 01:47.440
-Keep a close watch on this shipment.
-Yes, sir.

02:22.160 --> 02:23.160
Huan.

02:44.480 --> 02:45.360
Huan.

02:46.520 --> 02:47.560
Huan.

02:50.560 --> 02:51.640
Huan.

02:55.840 --> 02:58.800
I've already retired now.
I don't wish to be disturbed anymore.

02:58.880 --> 03:01.120
Please go back, Mr. Zheng Si.

03:04.360 --> 03:05.440
Huan,

03:06.440 --> 03:08.360
why are you treating me this way?

03:09.280 --> 03:10.840
Have you forgotten
how deeply I feel for you?

03:10.920 --> 03:12.720
Have you forgotten
all these years we spent together?

03:13.840 --> 03:15.440
Don't you trust me anymore?

03:15.960 --> 03:18.440
I don't trust you.
Whatever you say, I won't believe it.

03:18.520 --> 03:19.560
Go back.

03:21.880 --> 03:22.920
Huan.

03:27.200 --> 03:28.400
Look,

03:30.400 --> 03:32.160
I had no other choice.

03:33.360 --> 03:34.560
Zheng Wu

03:35.280 --> 03:36.240
reported me.

03:36.960 --> 03:39.480
My father beat me harshly.

03:41.320 --> 03:43.280
I had no choice, Huan.

03:44.040 --> 03:47.040
I agreed to it.
Only then did my father let me out.

03:48.360 --> 03:50.400
I had no other way to see you.

03:50.480 --> 03:52.360
-You must believe me, Huan.
-What about the letter?

03:53.480 --> 03:54.960
What was that letter about?

03:58.480 --> 04:00.000
I was forced.

04:01.000 --> 04:03.320
My father found out
about our relationship.

04:05.160 --> 04:07.960
He… forced me to write it.

04:08.040 --> 04:11.720
If I didn't comply,
he would've locked me up.

04:11.800 --> 04:14.040
During those days he kept me locked away,

04:14.120 --> 04:17.120
I thought about you day and night, Huan.

04:17.640 --> 04:19.640
You must believe me, Huan.

04:21.000 --> 04:22.640
You must believe me.

04:26.680 --> 04:29.200
Huan, please believe me.

04:33.440 --> 04:34.360
My father…

04:36.720 --> 04:39.560
he's forcing me to marry
a noble's legitimate daughter.

04:40.280 --> 04:41.800
I swore I'd never obey.

04:48.120 --> 04:48.960
I…

04:49.720 --> 04:52.080
I, Zheng Si,

04:53.360 --> 04:56.000
will openly and honorably
bring you into the Zheng family.

04:57.480 --> 05:00.240
You're the only one
I want in this lifetime, Huan.

05:02.040 --> 05:04.120
I want to take you far away.

05:05.440 --> 05:09.200
I want the whole world to know
that you are my wife.

05:09.720 --> 05:11.080
Huan,

05:17.400 --> 05:19.360
I'm afraid I can't believe you anymore.

05:21.120 --> 05:22.720
Is everything you say

05:24.200 --> 05:25.400
really true?

05:26.520 --> 05:28.200
Of course it's true.

05:29.160 --> 05:30.760
Huan, you must trust me.

05:31.640 --> 05:32.480
Huan,

05:33.760 --> 05:35.720
I have even better news for you.

05:36.520 --> 05:37.960
My mother has accepted you.

05:38.040 --> 05:41.320
You know, after the Cui family fell,

05:41.840 --> 05:44.200
life hasn't been easy for her
in the Zheng family.

05:44.960 --> 05:48.880
She still has some dowry left to sell off
to raise some cash.

05:49.960 --> 05:52.520
She mainly wants to leave us a way out.

05:54.200 --> 05:57.480
My mother also said,
the price isn't important.

05:58.600 --> 06:01.520
Just don't let the Zheng family find out.

06:02.480 --> 06:06.800
Huan, could you maybe ask
some of the songstresses around you?

06:17.760 --> 06:20.040
I can look into it,

06:20.120 --> 06:23.480
but I need to see those jewels first
before I make a decision.

06:25.360 --> 06:28.520
Alright.

06:29.040 --> 06:33.240
I will listen to only you in this life.

06:40.160 --> 06:41.120
Huan…

06:48.600 --> 06:50.320
-The Zheng family?
-Yes.

06:50.840 --> 06:52.440
I followed the family servants
to the Zheng estate

06:52.520 --> 06:53.800
and met the man they called Steward Zheng.

06:57.400 --> 07:00.680
On your journey to Yangzhou,
you carry a heavy duty.

07:00.760 --> 07:04.440
If you have an urgent need,
you can seek aid from the Zheng family.

07:04.520 --> 07:07.000
They've managed
the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild for years.

07:07.880 --> 07:10.720
They're a model of generosity
and integrity among merchants.

07:11.320 --> 07:13.360
From smuggling stolen goods
on official ships

07:13.440 --> 07:14.760
to the Black Dragon Bandits,

07:16.240 --> 07:17.360
the Zheng family

07:19.520 --> 07:21.160
and Xu Nanying…

07:24.960 --> 07:29.000
Prince Ying,
are you truly involved in this?

07:30.600 --> 07:32.480
Go to Zhe Chong Fu overnight
to request reinforcements.

07:32.560 --> 07:33.640
Tomorrow, we'll enter Yangzhou.

08:35.360 --> 08:37.360
And this one? What does it mean?

08:38.640 --> 08:39.880
This is…

08:50.720 --> 08:51.840
Keep your elbow level.

08:52.920 --> 08:53.840
Pull it back.

08:55.280 --> 08:56.240
Good.

11:27.720 --> 11:28.920
Tell me.

11:35.400 --> 11:37.000
How long do I have left to live?

11:56.440 --> 11:59.080
Today, I'll visit two more families.

11:59.160 --> 12:01.480
Yes. Ms. Su, today's gifts
are two more than yesterday.

12:01.560 --> 12:03.000
-Alright.
-Duanwu,

12:04.120 --> 12:05.400
I'm waiting for good news from you.

12:06.200 --> 12:07.960
-Be careful, Ms. Su.
-Alright.

12:08.480 --> 12:09.400
Off you go.

12:17.560 --> 12:19.320
I still have some stock
in Zhenlang Pavilion.

12:19.400 --> 12:20.720
You're welcome to use it for now.

12:30.480 --> 12:32.480
Since when has Mr. Yan become so generous?

12:33.920 --> 12:37.080
Partnering with the Zheng family
is like trying to get blood from a stone.

12:38.160 --> 12:41.000
If this fails, you'll have
no place left in Yangzhou.

12:42.240 --> 12:46.120
Do you want me to stay in Yangzhou or not?

12:47.600 --> 12:49.440
I don't understand what you want anymore.

12:49.960 --> 12:51.520
And I won't bother guessing.

12:53.760 --> 12:54.840
Thank you for your kindness.

13:09.640 --> 13:11.200
Where are you taking me?

13:11.920 --> 13:12.960
Right here.

13:13.720 --> 13:15.080
-It's right here?
-Yes.

13:26.960 --> 13:28.280
-Mr. Si.
-Well done.

13:42.560 --> 13:43.840
Huan, it's alright.

14:16.320 --> 14:18.320
How could there be so much jewelry?

14:18.400 --> 14:20.880
After all, my mother is
a legitimate daughter of the Cui family.

14:20.960 --> 14:22.480
It's natural her dowry was generous.

14:26.760 --> 14:29.960
These pieces are fine enough,

14:30.760 --> 14:32.280
but…

14:33.560 --> 14:34.880
But what?

14:35.760 --> 14:41.280
In big families' marriages,
dowries are always in matching pairs.

14:42.560 --> 14:46.560
Why is Lady Cui's dowry collection
so mismatched?

14:49.440 --> 14:52.680
Cui and Zheng families were allied,
but my mother was a second wife.

14:52.760 --> 14:54.960
Whatever the Cui family gave, she wore.

14:55.560 --> 14:58.040
How could she dare to choose?

15:01.880 --> 15:02.880
Huan,

15:04.040 --> 15:07.640
I heard Su Muzhe is buying old jewelry.

15:08.160 --> 15:10.800
There's a notice posted at Clear Mind.

15:11.320 --> 15:13.720
You might as well call her here.

15:17.680 --> 15:18.800
Let's not.

15:19.440 --> 15:22.080
Don't I know how much money she has?

15:22.600 --> 15:24.520
She's used to getting
something for nothing.

15:24.600 --> 15:25.760
We shouldn't let her have it cheap.

15:26.680 --> 15:29.760
With so many fine jewels here,
if we lower the price just a little,

15:29.840 --> 15:31.800
people will be eager to buy.

15:35.480 --> 15:36.880
You're absolutely right.

15:38.240 --> 15:39.440
Keep an eye on things.

15:39.520 --> 15:41.680
I'll head out for some matters
and be back soon.

16:11.640 --> 16:12.520
It's blood!

16:16.720 --> 16:20.320
Mr. Si, how long
will it take to sell all this?

16:20.400 --> 16:22.000
We can't afford any delays.

16:22.080 --> 16:24.080
The longer it takes, the greater the risk.

16:25.360 --> 16:28.360
I'll find a way
to lure someone from Clear Mind.

16:28.440 --> 16:31.000
The jewelry guild joins forces
to suppress Clear Mind.

16:31.080 --> 16:33.360
Why would you feed her?

16:33.440 --> 16:38.920
Do you not know who's backing Clear Mind?

16:39.680 --> 16:43.440
-Mr. Si, are you targeting Mr. Wu…
-Steward Zheng,

16:43.520 --> 16:46.640
after handling these matters
for my father all these years,

16:47.760 --> 16:49.000
aren't you afraid?

16:52.000 --> 16:55.200
There always needs to be someone to blame.

16:57.640 --> 17:00.720
Figure out a way
to get the word to Clear Mind.

17:40.120 --> 17:40.960
What's wrong?

17:47.440 --> 17:48.480
Do you like it?

17:52.480 --> 17:55.680
If you like it, then wear it. Here.

18:04.960 --> 18:05.880
Does it look good?

18:05.960 --> 18:07.240
It looks beautiful.

18:07.760 --> 18:09.600
Anything you wear is beautiful.

18:11.840 --> 18:12.920
Then I'll look around some more.

18:24.040 --> 18:26.720
Yunxiu, take a break.

18:26.800 --> 18:28.560
We haven't had many customers these days.

18:28.640 --> 18:30.400
Why keep wiping everything over and over?

18:30.480 --> 18:34.200
Without new stock in our store,
it's hard to attract people.

18:36.280 --> 18:37.720
We're not closing down, are we?

18:38.480 --> 18:41.000
I feel like my life
is just starting to look up.

18:41.080 --> 18:43.200
-What do we do?
-Stop it!

18:44.000 --> 18:45.800
-Alright.
-Stop saying such unlucky things.

18:45.880 --> 18:47.240
I believe in Duanwu.

18:47.800 --> 18:50.840
She's been through so much hardship.
We'll find a way.

18:51.640 --> 18:53.600
Yes, I was just complaining.

18:54.280 --> 18:56.280
Lady Shiqi!

18:56.800 --> 18:58.280
-Shou!
-Shou?

18:58.360 --> 19:00.840
You came by yourself? Where's your leader?

19:00.920 --> 19:02.960
He went to help my father move.

19:04.440 --> 19:05.880
He's really such a good guy.

19:06.400 --> 19:08.760
I'm here because my leader
has a message for you.

19:08.840 --> 19:11.720
He said there's a family
by the Riverside Alley selling jewelry.

19:11.800 --> 19:13.080
They want you to take a look.

19:13.840 --> 19:14.720
Really?

19:15.600 --> 19:17.040
Here's the map he drew.

19:19.760 --> 19:21.760
MAP

19:23.320 --> 19:25.280
Look, here's our opportunity.

19:33.680 --> 19:37.320
Didn't we say to leave
such tasks to the servants?

19:37.400 --> 19:39.200
What if you tire yourself out?

19:39.280 --> 19:40.360
You keep saying that,

19:40.440 --> 19:43.360
but I'm locked up here every day
with someone following my every move.

19:43.440 --> 19:45.600
If I don't find something to do,
I'd be bored to death.

19:45.680 --> 19:48.120
It's only for your safety.

19:48.640 --> 19:50.280
Don't go wandering around for now.

19:50.360 --> 19:55.120
But with so much inventory,
how long will it take to sell it all?

19:55.200 --> 19:56.720
I'm going crazy.

19:57.320 --> 19:58.280
It won't take long.

19:59.440 --> 20:01.000
The big customer is coming.

20:32.480 --> 20:33.800
Apologies, Master.

20:33.880 --> 20:37.080
I heard there's jewelry for sale here,
so I came to take a look.

20:38.320 --> 20:39.160
Where are you from?

20:39.240 --> 20:40.720
I'm from Clear Mind.

20:42.000 --> 20:43.520
From Clear Mind? Please, come in.

20:51.880 --> 20:53.960
You keep explaining nothing.

20:54.480 --> 20:56.840
I don't care. I'm going out for a stroll.
Tell your people not to follow me.

21:02.680 --> 21:03.680
Shiqi!

21:13.400 --> 21:14.480
Miss, here.

21:18.960 --> 21:19.800
Feel free to look around.

21:24.880 --> 21:26.160
This is Hetian jade?

21:26.240 --> 21:28.120
Yes. Yes.

21:28.200 --> 21:31.600
Such carving patterns
are rare in Yangzhou.

21:41.520 --> 21:43.600
Don't shout.

21:46.760 --> 21:47.760
Don't shout.

21:56.600 --> 21:58.400
These as well. Here, take a look.

22:01.040 --> 22:02.920
How is there so much jewelry
from the Western Regions?

22:03.800 --> 22:05.800
Don't worry about whether it's from
the Western Regions or the Tang Empire.

22:05.880 --> 22:07.320
It's cheap, anyway.

22:17.520 --> 22:19.360
Didn't I say not to involve Clear Mind?

22:19.440 --> 22:20.880
Why shouldn't I?

22:20.960 --> 22:23.120
Because these things
have a questionable origin!

22:23.840 --> 22:24.880
Huan,

22:25.400 --> 22:26.840
let's not spell it out.

22:26.920 --> 22:28.480
Just help me dispose
of these things quickly,

22:28.560 --> 22:30.000
and I'll take you far away.

22:32.920 --> 22:35.640
You're deceiving me
into fencing stolen goods for you?

22:35.720 --> 22:37.000
What do you take me for?

22:37.600 --> 22:39.280
What do I take you for?

22:39.800 --> 22:41.080
I should be asking you that.

22:41.880 --> 22:44.960
Why did you accept Zheng Wu's support
for the top beauty title

22:45.040 --> 22:46.720
and even invest in Clear Mind?

22:47.320 --> 22:50.000
You know full well
that this illegitimate son

22:50.080 --> 22:52.200
is always competing with me
for the family assets.

22:53.600 --> 22:56.200
I invested in Clear Mind
because of Su Muzhe.

22:56.280 --> 22:57.840
It has nothing to do with Zheng Wu.

22:58.360 --> 22:59.640
Let Lady Shiqi go.

23:01.440 --> 23:02.360
No.

23:04.800 --> 23:06.160
You won't do it, right?

23:07.840 --> 23:10.160
-Fine, I will.
-Huan!

23:13.480 --> 23:14.480
Miss.

23:15.080 --> 23:17.840
That's our manager.
Seems like he's upset again.

23:17.920 --> 23:20.400
Here, look at this. There's more here.

23:21.960 --> 23:24.240
Miss, did you bring money?

23:28.640 --> 23:32.800
I didn't bring money today,
but I can sign a contract.

23:33.320 --> 23:34.560
You actually planned

23:34.640 --> 23:37.240
to smuggle jewelry
out through a food container?

23:43.160 --> 23:46.040
Why?

23:53.560 --> 23:56.240
Huan. I'm sorry…

23:56.320 --> 23:57.880
I'm sorry…

23:57.960 --> 23:59.440
Why?

24:00.040 --> 24:01.760
Why did you hide them?

24:01.840 --> 24:03.800
Why did you lie to me?

24:03.880 --> 24:05.680
Enough. Stop acting!

24:05.760 --> 24:08.520
I'm going to report you. Report!

24:08.600 --> 24:10.120
Is that Lady Huan?

24:24.600 --> 24:27.600
I trusted you again and again,

24:28.440 --> 24:30.000
but what are you doing?

24:30.080 --> 24:32.280
What are you making me do for you?

24:32.360 --> 24:34.720
I did all of this for you.

24:34.800 --> 24:37.080
I wanted to marry you
into the Zheng family quickly.

24:39.840 --> 24:41.080
Marry me?

24:44.320 --> 24:47.640
How many times
have you said that over the years?

24:47.720 --> 24:49.960
Ask yourself honestly.

24:51.160 --> 24:53.520
Do you even believe yourself?

24:57.640 --> 24:59.360
From now on,

25:00.960 --> 25:02.520
I won't believe you anymore.

25:03.240 --> 25:05.600
I can't stand watching
you do these dirty deeds.

25:05.680 --> 25:08.600
I'm going to report you!

25:13.120 --> 25:14.640
Huan. Huan.

25:31.080 --> 25:33.400
Do you think I don't want to marry you?

25:35.840 --> 25:38.720
What… What choice do I have?

25:41.320 --> 25:44.840
You know full well
this is a deal we both agreed upon.

25:45.440 --> 25:47.520
You're the one living in a dream.

25:49.520 --> 25:50.400
Speak up.

25:52.240 --> 25:53.960
Where did you hide the items?

25:54.640 --> 25:56.160
How much did you hide?

26:00.840 --> 26:02.320
If you tell me,

26:04.560 --> 26:06.040
I'll spare your life.

26:10.960 --> 26:11.960
Huan…

26:17.640 --> 26:18.560
Huan…

26:20.360 --> 26:21.360
Huan…

26:55.080 --> 26:56.360
What happened?

27:03.600 --> 27:05.320
Quickly, move the goods.

27:05.400 --> 27:07.680
-Clean up the place. Hurry!
-Yes!

27:09.200 --> 27:10.840
Get up. Come with me.

27:11.360 --> 27:12.520
Come on. Get up!

27:12.600 --> 27:14.680
Don't stay there. Come with me!
Move! Hurry!

27:26.560 --> 27:27.720
Yingtao.

27:28.600 --> 27:29.720
Shiqi.

27:35.400 --> 27:37.560
Ms. Su, you're back!

27:40.480 --> 27:42.000
Have all the gifts been delivered?

27:45.200 --> 27:47.040
Finally, some good news today.

27:47.120 --> 27:49.600
-We're not shut up anymore.
-That's great.

27:50.440 --> 27:54.440
Ms. Su, did you see Yunxiu
when you passed by Riverside Alley?

27:54.520 --> 27:56.320
Gaoshou said there were people
selling old jewelry there,

27:56.400 --> 27:57.400
so Yunxiu went to take a look.

27:59.320 --> 28:02.360
That's good news, but I didn't see Yunxiu.

28:02.440 --> 28:04.480
-How long has she been gone?
-Half a day.

28:05.240 --> 28:06.920
She's been gone half a day?

28:09.760 --> 28:10.680
I need to go look for her.

28:12.560 --> 28:14.880
When I'm not around, Yunxiu
never leaves the shop for this long.

28:14.960 --> 28:15.880
Hey…

29:34.880 --> 29:35.960
How did it go?

29:39.920 --> 29:42.440
The Zheng family received
a shipment from the west.

29:42.520 --> 29:44.360
It's been hidden in a residential house.

29:44.440 --> 29:46.840
Lady Huan is selling that batch now.

29:46.920 --> 29:49.920
Zhang Jinran arrived in Yangzhou
this morning and visited Zhe Chong Fu.

29:50.520 --> 29:51.960
Seems like he's mobilizing troops.

29:55.280 --> 29:56.440
Lady Huan…

29:59.360 --> 30:00.440
What about Duanwu?

30:01.800 --> 30:02.760
I don't know.

30:07.240 --> 30:09.840
Are you worried Duanwu might…

30:09.920 --> 30:11.080
go buy that jewelry?

30:12.120 --> 30:16.240
If she buys that jewelry,
she'll be dealing in stolen goods.

30:17.200 --> 30:18.680
We must find her immediately.

30:23.680 --> 30:25.640
-Is this the place, Gaoshou?
-Yes, this is it.

30:29.560 --> 30:30.600
Anyone here?

30:31.280 --> 30:32.600
Yunxiu!

30:34.240 --> 30:35.720
-Yunxiu!
-No one's here?

30:35.800 --> 30:37.000
Could they have already left?

30:40.960 --> 30:43.160
Don't worry, Ms. Su. I'll go in and check.

30:43.240 --> 30:44.720
-How will you get in?
-Don't worry.

30:44.800 --> 30:45.680
Gaoshou!

31:04.840 --> 31:05.680
Yunxiu!

31:18.400 --> 31:19.480
Yunxiu!

31:19.560 --> 31:22.560
Yunxiu!

31:23.120 --> 31:25.000
Ms. Su, don't worry.
She's just unconscious.

31:25.080 --> 31:26.520
It's alright. Don't worry.

31:28.560 --> 31:29.520
Yunxiu…

31:31.560 --> 31:33.880
Shiqi. Yunxiu. Wake up!

31:35.240 --> 31:37.480
Ms. Su,
there's another lady lying over there.

31:47.600 --> 31:48.520
Yunxiu…

31:50.880 --> 31:52.080
Yunxiu…

31:52.160 --> 31:54.840
Ms. Su, come and look.
She doesn't seem to be breathing.

31:56.160 --> 31:57.400
Go take a look.

32:00.200 --> 32:01.880
Hurry, take a look.

32:15.160 --> 32:17.000
Lady Huan…

32:17.720 --> 32:18.560
Lady Huan…

32:20.160 --> 32:22.560
Lady Huan…

32:23.080 --> 32:26.680
Wake up, Lady Huan…
Gaoshou, quickly, call for help!

32:26.760 --> 32:29.040
But… She… She's not breathing.

32:29.640 --> 32:30.920
Ms. Su…

32:31.000 --> 32:32.680
Lady Huan…

32:39.200 --> 32:40.360
Seal off this courtyard.

32:40.440 --> 32:41.800
-Search!
-Yes, sir!

32:45.920 --> 32:49.320
-Huan…
-We have to go!

32:50.040 --> 32:51.680
Ms. Su, we really have to go!

32:51.760 --> 32:53.840
The guards are here. Ms. Su, let's go!

33:01.600 --> 33:02.440
Search!

33:05.240 --> 33:06.560
We have to leave now, Ms. Su.

33:06.640 --> 33:07.880
It's just the two of us left alive here.

33:07.960 --> 33:10.440
If we don't leave,
we can't clear our names!

33:11.240 --> 33:12.280
Let's go!

33:14.960 --> 33:16.240
Quickly, let's go!

33:37.440 --> 33:39.480
Inspector Zhang,
we found a woman's corpse.

34:08.120 --> 34:10.719
Sir, looks like they escaped
through the window.

34:37.800 --> 34:39.159
It's not Duanwu.

34:40.480 --> 34:41.639
-Take it away.
-Yes.

34:47.480 --> 34:49.800
Send out everyone. Duanwu must be found.

34:50.320 --> 34:51.199
Understood.

34:55.960 --> 34:58.040
What's going on?
Are you close with that lady?

35:00.920 --> 35:03.840
Listen, put Yunxiu down now
and just leave.

35:03.920 --> 35:05.680
This has nothing to do with you.

35:05.760 --> 35:06.680
No way. I can't leave.

35:06.760 --> 35:08.920
Lady Shiqi went there to buy jewelry
because of me.

35:09.000 --> 35:11.160
-I have to handle this!
-This is no trivial matter.

35:11.240 --> 35:12.400
Someone has already died.

35:12.920 --> 35:13.920
I still can't leave!

35:14.000 --> 35:15.080
I can't just abandon
the two of you ladies here.

35:15.160 --> 35:16.720
This isn't something I can ignore!

35:24.760 --> 35:26.560
Inspector Zhang, what an honor!

35:26.640 --> 35:27.920
Forgive me for not welcoming you sooner.

35:28.000 --> 35:29.640
No need for formalities, Mr. Zheng.

35:29.720 --> 35:30.720
Please, this way.

35:32.200 --> 35:33.480
Before I came to Yangzhou,

35:33.560 --> 35:35.600
Prince Ying kept mentioning you.

35:36.120 --> 35:39.240
He said the Zheng family of Yangzhou
is a model of generosity

35:39.320 --> 35:41.280
and integrity among merchants.

35:41.360 --> 35:43.000
Prince Ying truly flatters us.

35:43.080 --> 35:45.000
The Zheng family
hardly deserves such praise.

35:46.320 --> 35:48.440
Inspector Zhang, your visit is sudden.

35:48.520 --> 35:50.080
May I ask what brings you here?

35:50.160 --> 35:52.280
If there's anything you need,
please say the word.

35:52.360 --> 35:55.160
The entire Zheng family
is at your service.

35:55.720 --> 35:57.000
Well, Mr. Zheng,

35:57.080 --> 35:59.280
I do indeed have a matter today.

36:00.040 --> 36:00.960
Please go ahead.

36:04.520 --> 36:05.600
Take a look at this.

36:07.800 --> 36:09.720
Earlier today, at a residence in Yangzhou,

36:10.480 --> 36:13.200
Lady Huan, the top beauty
of the Qionghua Festival, was found dead.

36:13.280 --> 36:14.760
Lady Huan is dead?

36:16.840 --> 36:19.080
This was found in her hand.

36:19.160 --> 36:20.320
So, I thought,

36:20.400 --> 36:22.360
perhaps you could provide some insight.

36:22.440 --> 36:25.680
After all, not just any family
could afford such material.

36:28.440 --> 36:31.880
Inspector Zhang,
based on just this sleeve,

36:31.960 --> 36:34.000
I see no particular clues.

36:34.080 --> 36:35.320
Of course.

36:36.000 --> 36:37.800
But I asked the tailor,

36:37.880 --> 36:41.440
and he said that Zheng Wu
specifically chose this material

36:41.520 --> 36:42.960
for the edges of his sleeves.

36:43.640 --> 36:45.720
Did the tailor say

36:45.800 --> 36:49.560
that only my son Zheng Wu
used this material?

36:49.640 --> 36:50.720
Not exactly.

36:50.800 --> 36:52.440
However, the lead is there.

36:52.520 --> 36:55.360
I'm newly appointed,
and it's my duty to investigate.

36:55.440 --> 36:56.960
I have to look into it.

36:57.040 --> 36:58.560
I hope you understand.

37:00.720 --> 37:01.960
It's only right to cooperate.

37:02.480 --> 37:04.280
Then, forgive me for any offense.

37:07.440 --> 37:08.480
Search!

37:26.560 --> 37:27.720
Master Zheng,

37:27.800 --> 37:30.480
may I ask where your son Zheng Wu is now?

37:30.560 --> 37:33.520
Zheng Wu… He… He should be…

37:39.720 --> 37:40.960
Where were you?

37:42.040 --> 37:44.360
Reporting to Father,
feeling bored and alone,

37:44.440 --> 37:46.400
so I went to the lakeside pavilion
for a few drinks.

37:47.800 --> 37:50.320
Were you… alone?

37:50.920 --> 37:53.480
Master, I was with Mr. Wu.

37:54.000 --> 37:56.800
Wu, if there was indeed
someone else present,

37:56.880 --> 37:57.800
you should say so now.

37:57.880 --> 38:01.120
Today, Inspector Zhang is here
investigating a murder case.

38:01.200 --> 38:02.520
Murder?

38:05.680 --> 38:07.960
I was simply drinking with Garuda.

38:08.480 --> 38:10.240
How could this
have anything to do with a murder?

38:10.320 --> 38:12.840
Zheng Wu, look closely at this garment.

38:12.920 --> 38:14.360
Do you recognize it?

38:18.360 --> 38:19.960
Responding to Inspector Zhang,

38:20.720 --> 38:23.760
I have dozens of pieces, worn or unworn.

38:23.840 --> 38:25.680
I give away quite a few as well.

38:25.760 --> 38:26.760
This one…

38:27.840 --> 38:28.720
I don't remember it.

38:29.320 --> 38:32.440
It was found at the crime scene,
and it was found in your trunk.

38:33.040 --> 38:35.680
-Do you dare say you don't recognize it?
-I…

38:38.960 --> 38:41.240
Inspector Zhang, Father,

38:41.760 --> 38:44.040
maybe some thief secretly wore it.

38:44.640 --> 38:47.120
How could Zheng Wu be a murderer?

38:47.200 --> 38:50.400
So, you mean to say
someone is framing him?

38:50.480 --> 38:52.840
Maybe it's a misunderstanding.

38:59.800 --> 39:01.360
But given the severity,

39:01.440 --> 39:04.080
Master Zheng, since the Zheng family
is implicated,

39:04.160 --> 39:06.080
I still need an explanation.

39:06.680 --> 39:07.800
Master!

39:08.320 --> 39:09.800
Master!

39:10.320 --> 39:12.200
Master! Master, bad news!

39:12.280 --> 39:14.120
Two of the elders are causing
an uproar in the ancestral hall.

39:14.200 --> 39:15.960
Seems to be about
Mr. Wu committing murder.

39:16.040 --> 39:17.600
This matter hasn't been resolved yet.

39:17.680 --> 39:18.880
What are they trying to do?

39:19.680 --> 39:23.280
Father, perhaps the elders
have been misled by outside rumors.

39:23.360 --> 39:24.600
The Zhe Chong Fu handles cases

39:25.760 --> 39:27.280
without leaking a trace of information.

39:28.200 --> 39:29.080
Yes.

39:33.920 --> 39:34.880
Master Zheng,

39:35.960 --> 39:38.720
I shouldn't interfere
in your family matters,

39:39.240 --> 39:41.320
but since the two elders
are here over this case,

39:42.280 --> 39:44.960
might I visit the ancestral hall?

39:47.160 --> 39:49.920
The ancestral hall is sacred ground.
Outsiders typically aren't allowed.

39:50.000 --> 39:52.680
But as the Inspector of Huainandao,

39:53.280 --> 39:55.280
you're both an esteemed official
and honored guest.

39:55.880 --> 39:59.520
This case is significant,
and it concerns the Zheng family.

40:00.360 --> 40:03.640
Please, help us uphold justice.

40:05.880 --> 40:06.720
Much obliged, Master Zheng.

40:08.160 --> 40:09.200
After you.

40:33.360 --> 40:34.280
Here they come.

40:34.840 --> 40:37.240
The Zheng family has maintained
its good name for centuries.

40:37.320 --> 40:39.960
We can't let it be ruined
by an unfilial son!

40:40.040 --> 40:42.840
Brother, lower your voice.
This is hardly a point of pride.

40:42.920 --> 40:45.840
This scoundrel, who else could it be?

40:46.640 --> 40:48.360
We don't know the full story yet,

40:48.440 --> 40:49.720
and here you are making a scene
in the ancestral hall.

40:49.800 --> 40:51.960
Are you trying to give
Inspector Zhang a show?

40:53.240 --> 40:55.560
-Inspector Zhang.
-No need for such formality, elders.

40:58.560 --> 41:01.440
Eldest Brother, the inspector is here.

41:01.520 --> 41:02.960
If Zheng Wu is convicted,

41:03.040 --> 41:06.360
what will people think the Zheng family,
the head of Yangzhou's Jewel Guild?

41:06.440 --> 41:08.600
Second Uncle, please calm down.

41:08.680 --> 41:09.880
Inspector Zhang is here.

41:09.960 --> 41:11.640
Until we get to the bottom of this,

41:11.720 --> 41:13.040
let's not speak recklessly.

41:13.120 --> 41:14.400
For my father's sake,

41:14.920 --> 41:16.520
please, you and Third Uncle,
return for now.

41:18.920 --> 41:20.560
Elders, please stay.

41:20.640 --> 41:23.400
I'm puzzled by one thing.

41:24.160 --> 41:28.240
Why did you arrive
right after Inspector Zhang?

41:28.320 --> 41:31.360
Have you planted informants
in the government?

41:31.440 --> 41:33.280
-You…
-How dare you slander your elders!

41:33.360 --> 41:35.160
Zheng Wu wouldn't commit murder!

41:35.240 --> 41:36.120
-Master.
-Mom.

41:36.200 --> 41:38.560
You can't let outsiders
falsely accuse our son!

41:38.640 --> 41:40.120
A mere concubine,

41:40.200 --> 41:41.720
how dare you trespass
in the ancestral hall

41:41.800 --> 41:43.840
and call the family elders "outsiders"?

41:43.920 --> 41:47.600
Such insolence! Guards, drag her out!

41:48.360 --> 41:51.800
Don't touch me! I'm a rightful concubine!

41:51.880 --> 41:54.480
Your Cui family committed fraud
with tribute pearls.

41:54.560 --> 41:58.000
Now that your family has fallen,
can you claim to be spotless?

41:58.080 --> 41:59.800
You… Such insolence!

41:59.880 --> 42:01.200
Drag her out, now!

42:01.280 --> 42:02.320
-Master…
-Don't listen to her nonsense!

42:02.400 --> 42:03.840
Enough, all of you!

42:05.600 --> 42:06.600
Inspector Zhang is still here.

42:06.680 --> 42:08.280
Do you realize
how disgraceful you're acting?

42:09.520 --> 42:10.640
Zheng Wu…

42:11.520 --> 42:13.800
I believe you didn't commit murder.

42:13.880 --> 42:17.760
But do you dare swear it
before our ancestors?

42:18.360 --> 42:19.840
Why wouldn't I?

42:27.320 --> 42:30.080
By the honor of my ancestors,
Zheng Family's Zheng Wu…

42:33.800 --> 42:36.800
-Eldest Brother! The ancestors are angry!
-By the ancestors…

42:36.880 --> 42:37.800
The ancestors are angry!

42:37.880 --> 42:39.360
The ancestors are expelling
this illegitimate son!

42:39.440 --> 42:40.760
Yes, indeed! What should we do?

42:40.840 --> 42:42.920
Eldest Brother, make a decision!

42:43.000 --> 42:44.640
This is a grave matter!

42:44.720 --> 42:46.080
-What should we do?
-Quickly,

42:46.160 --> 42:48.080
-fetch the other elders!
-Okay.

42:48.160 --> 42:50.480
Ancestors, calm your rage!

42:50.560 --> 42:53.320
Master Zheng,
this is of utmost importance.

42:53.400 --> 42:55.000
Since the Zheng family
is all gathered here,

42:55.080 --> 42:56.720
seal the doors.

42:56.800 --> 42:59.040
I'll question each person, one by one.

42:59.120 --> 43:01.840
Master, Mr. Xu
from the Grand Governor's Office is here!

43:03.120 --> 43:04.160
Jinran,

43:04.240 --> 43:07.880
you've come to Yangzhou.
Why didn't you inform me beforehand

43:08.400 --> 43:10.520
so I could come greet you?

43:10.600 --> 43:12.640
You see, I had to search high and low.

43:13.760 --> 43:16.320
Something came up along the way,
so I've been in Yangzhou for two days.

43:19.000 --> 43:21.120
This is the ancestral hall
of the Zheng family, right?

43:21.880 --> 43:24.360
Let's talk elsewhere.
